    "ruleType": "unit-ability",
    "group": "Ambull",
    "summary": "Twice per battle, as your opponent's turn ends, you can take this model off the battlefield, provided it is not in **Engagement Range** of any enemy unit. Then:\n\n- in [your next Movement phase](vsdata:core-rule/movement-phase), during its Reinforcements step, place it anywhere more than 9\" horizontally from every enemy model\n- it is **destroyed** if the battle ends while it is off the battlefield",
